WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I thought there was nothing wrong with me, so I thought about embroidering my forehead.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,120
It was given to the old lady during the Chinese New Year and was embroidered in Songhetang.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,720
Being in front of the old lady every day, it is inevitable that traces will be recorded and there will be no surprises.

4
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,320
Please come to your aunt's place and finish the embroidery quietly.

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,320
I hope my aunt can help me hide it.

6
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,120
If you have this kind of filial piety, the old lady will definitely be happy.

7
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:21,320
Go and get my sewing shop too.

8
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:25,060
I want to embroider a pair of tiger head shoes.

9
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:30,060
There is an old saying that if a lady embroiders more shoes for children, it will bring good luck.

10
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:35,060
My uncle was clearly not in the house a few days ago. What happened to the marks on my aunt's body?

11
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:38,060
Are these tiger-head shoes really for good luck?

12
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:41,060
Why is this three-bedroom courtyard so weird?

13
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:46,090
Auntie, it's getting late. It's time for Yunlan to go back. Don't leave in a hurry.
